 "translation": "Just at the mention of Saeed's name, I start to feel restless. You are a person with a soul like Rahat. You made an excellent point that you once showed me kindness. You can guess from my answer what happened to him. First, he was a little surprised, then very surprised, and then even more so. Later, I heard that he was very ashamed of his mistake. He said to his conscience that he had misunderstood me. I thought that perhaps I had pitied him. God knows what right he had to pity me, and what kind of pity it was, that has not become clear to me even today. Here, this long story turned out to be about Saeed only. I said, didn't I, that even if I just talk, these people of the world mess that up too.",
